# dead-ride-record — the decision table (family contract in fixture.yaml).
# id                     | world | patch                                         | env | expect                 | params
died-branch-pushed       |       |                                               |     | died-branch-pushed     |
finalized-control        |       |                                               |     | finalized-control      |
already-recorded         |       |                                               |     | already-recorded       |
prior-attempt-record     |       |                                               |     | prior-attempt-record   |
oom-killed               |       | kubectl/get-pods.json @ patches/oom.jq        |     | oom-killed             |
branch-ambiguous         |       |                                               |     | branch-ambiguous       |
comments-unreadable      |       |                                               | STUB_GH_api_repos_teststuffstash_homelab_issues_3303_comments_per_page_100=fail | comments-unreadable    |
still-settling           |       | kubectl/get-pods.json @ patches/settling.jq   |     | still-settling         |
# the janitor spares a Failed pod until its agent ended RIDE_ENDED_JANITOR_S ago (a deadline kill's
# Failed moment is past any startTime-only grace): the margin set wide, the death is recorded AND kept.
deadline-kill-recorded-spared |  |                                          | RIDE_ENDED_JANITOR_S=999999999 | deadline-kill-recorded-spared |
